<div class="visual-wrap">

    <div class="visual">
        <div class="scene01">
            <div class="inner02">
                <p class="v-tit01"><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/scene01_tit01.png" alt="전국의 기숙학원에 묻습니다" /></p>
                <div class="scene01_obj01">
                    <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/scene01_obj01.png" alt="" />
                </div>
                <p class="scene01-txt scene01-txt01">
                    <strong>수업은 적고, 자습시간은 <br> 많이 확보</strong>하면서 <br>
                   <strong> 유명한 인강 선생님 수업</strong>을 <br>
                    들을 수 있는 기숙학원 있나요?
                </p>
                <p class="scene01-txt scene01-txt02">수학만 올라가도 <br> 의대 갈 수 있는데 <br>
                    <strong> 부족한 수학점수를<br>확 끌어올려주는 기숙학원</strong> <br>
                    있을까요?
                </p>
                <p class="scene01-txt scene01-txt03">
                    다른 거 말고 <br> 공부에만 신경 쓰고 싶은데 <br>
                    <strong>남학생, 여학생만 따로 있는<br> 기숙학원</strong> 어디 있나요? 
                </p>
                <p class="scene01-txt scene01-txt04">
                    잠은 편하게 자고,<br> 룸메 스트레스 받기 싫은데 <br>
                    <strong>공부에만 집중할 수 있는 <br>시설 좋은 기숙학원</strong> 어디 있나요?
                </p>
            </div>      
            <div class="scene01_curtain">
                <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/scene01_curtain.png" alt="" />
            </div>
            <div class="scene01_redlight">
                <img class="redlight01" src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/red_light01.png" alt="" />
                <img class="redlight02" src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/red_light02.png" alt="" />
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="scene02">
            <div class="inner02">
                <div class="title-box">
                    <p class="title01">
                        학생&middot;학부모 니즈를 <br>
                        앞서 담아낸 기숙학원
                    </p>
                    <p class="title02">러셀</p>
                </div>
                <div class="obj-light">
                    <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/obj_light.png" alt="" />
                </div>  
            </div>          
        </div>
        <div class="scene03">
            <div class="inner02">               
                <p class="obj01">
                    <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/scene03_obj_txt01.png" alt="" />
                </p>
                <p class="obj02">
                    <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/scene03_obj_txt02.png" alt="" />
                </p>

                <p class="obj-txt">
                    선수(選手) : 어떤 일을 매우 능숙하게 하는 사람, 즉 <strong>베테랑</strong> <br>
                    선수(先手)치다 : 남보다 <strong>앞서 행동하다</strong>
                </p>
                <p class="scene03-txt">
                    매년 3,500여명의 졸업생을 배출하는 <br>
                    <strong>베테랑 러셀 기숙학원이 2026학년도 또 다른 기적을 위해 앞서갑니다.</strong>
                </p>
            </div>  
        </div>    
        <div class="inner02">
            <p class="scene03-tit01">
                <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/scene03-tit01.png" alt="선수가" />
            </p>
            <p class="scene03-tit02">
                <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/scene03-tit02.png" alt="선수치다" />
            </p>
            <div class="scene03-light">
                <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/scene03_light.png" alt="" />
            </div>      
            <p class="scene03-obj03">
                <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/scene03_obj03.png" alt="" />
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="visual-content">
            <div class="inner02">
                <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/visual_content.png" alt="" />
                <!-- <div class="icon-n" data-aos="flip-right">
                    <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/ico_new.png" alt="" />
                </div> -->
            </div>
        </div> 
        <div class="ico-scroll">
            <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/ico_scroll.png" alt="">
        </div>
        <div class="quick">                  
            <a class="q-ban targetPos" href="#academy">
                <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/quick_banner.png" alt="">
            </a>   
            <!-- <a class="q-ban mt20" href="/event/2026/gisuk_pre/index.asp" target="_blank">
                <img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/intro/2024/gisuk_gate/alarm_banner.png" alt="">
            </a>-->
        </div>
    </div>
</div>



